# Native natural-six realization of the MS93 setup

The original intrinsic pair and its commutator-preserving characteristic
replacement carry the same natural S6 coordinates and marked fixed vector.
Both supply the actual holomorph tree geometry, while the replacement also
satisfies characteristic minimality. The source projection is allowed to
have image A6 or S6; no unrelated linear-three projection is introduced.
